    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Shapers is a fast-paced competitive puzzle game where quick thinking and geometric mastery determine who's the ultimate Shape Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alongside (or against) your friend in this quirky factory setting where you'll combine lines into increasingly complex shapes. Make a mistake, and the factory loses trust - sending you back to the basics. Can you maintain precision under pressure and outperform your rival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501630/extras/09f6230b333c6b641a98150b22244f87.webp?t=1743640030\" width=584 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Competitive Multiplayer Action:</i> Challenge your friend in intense head-to-head matches where speed and precision are key to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic Shape Creation:</i> Master the art of combining 6 unique line types to create an infinite variety of geometric patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progressive Challenge System:</i> Start with simple shapes and work your way up to complex geometric masterpieces - but don't slip up, or it's back to basics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Industrial Puzzle Environment:</i> Experience shape-making mayhem amid a backdrop of conveyor belts and whirring machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501630/extras/09f6230b333c6b641a98150b22244f87.webp?t=1743640030\" width=584 height=40 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Shapers includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct line types for endless shape-crafting possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer mode to perfect your shape-making skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and remote play multiplayer for intense 1v1 competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system to track your geometric mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate master of geometric manipulation? Join our factory workforce today and show your friend who's the real Shape Shaper!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Shapers is a fast-paced competitive puzzle game where quick thinking and geometric mastery determine who's the ultimate Shape Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alongside (or against) your friend in this quirky factory setting where you'll combine lines into increasingly complex shapes. Make a mistake, and the factory loses trust - sending you back to the basics. Can you maintain precision under pressure and outperform your rival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501630/extras/09f6230b333c6b641a98150b22244f87.webp?t=1743640030\" width=584 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Competitive Multiplayer Action:</i> Challenge your friend in intense head-to-head matches where speed and precision are key to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic Shape Creation:</i> Master the art of combining 6 unique line types to create an infinite variety of geometric patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progressive Challenge System:</i> Start with simple shapes and work your way up to complex geometric masterpieces - but don't slip up, or it's back to basics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Industrial Puzzle Environment:</i> Experience shape-making mayhem amid a backdrop of conveyor belts and whirring machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501630/extras/09f6230b333c6b641a98150b22244f87.webp?t=1743640030\" width=584 height=40 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Shapers includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct line types for endless shape-crafting possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer mode to perfect your shape-making skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and remote play multiplayer for intense 1v1 competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system to track your geometric mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate master of geometric manipulation? Join our factory workforce today and show your friend who's the real Shape Shaper!</p>",
